3. Identity I_v11 = I_c + (I(rho_A) + I(rho_B))/2 on random two-qubit states
   max deviation over 2000 states: 2.22e-16  (an algebraic identity: log4 - S = [1-S_A]+[1-S_B]+I)
   Separable (|00><00|+|11><11|)/2: I_c = 1/2; Werner(p) I_c = I_v11 = 1 - S/2. Crossing p:
   p* = 0.7476 (phase-2 report corrects 0.749 -> 0.7476)
